  /* clustering, from the course handbook */
  EightRunsLloyd: ['Each iteration has two moves: every run joins its nearest centroid, then each centroid moves to the mean of its runs. $J$ is the total squared distance to the assigned centroid.', 'Press Next and predict the colours before each step, then check them against the two distance columns in the table. Compare both starts.'],
