  EmLatencies: ['The E-step finds responsibilities from the current means. The M-step finds means from the responsibilities. Each pair of steps cannot lower the log-likelihood.', 'Press Next, and watch the 22 ms row of the table and both means. Compare the final means with the K-means result in the status line.'],
