  DbscanLab: ['A cluster is a connected set of dense neighbourhoods. Points in sparse regions are labelled noise and not forced into a cluster.', 'On the moons, sweep $\\varepsilon$ from small to large and find where the two moons appear. On the second dataset, try to recover both groups with one setting.'],
